---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-photo">
      <img src="/assets/photos/dr-suraga-white-coat-full.jpg"
        alt="Dr. Suraga Belakawadi in a white coat"
        sizes="(min-width: 60em) 40vw, 100vw"
        loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>

    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1 class="nameplate-name">{{ site.name }}</h1>
      <p class="nameplate-degrees">{{ site.degrees }}</p>
      <p class="nameplate-fellowship">{{ site.fellowship }}<br>{{ site.honours }}</p>
      <hr class="nameplate-rule">
      <p class="nameplate-role">{{ site.title }}</p>
      <p class="nameplate-place">{{ site.position }}, {{ site.hospital }}, {{ site.area }}</p>

      <p class="lede">I treat cancers of the digestive system, breast, female reproductive organs, head and neck, and soft tissues. Where it is the right choice for you, I use robotic or keyhole surgery, which means smaller cuts and usually a quicker return to normal life.</p>

      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/appointment/">Book appointment</a>
        <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappLink(site.whatsappMessage) }}">{{ icon("whatsapp") }}WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-hours">{{ icon("clock") }}Clinic: {{ site.hours }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="treat-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="treat-heading">Cancers I treat</h2>
      <p>Each page explains the condition in plain language: warning signs, tests, treatment options and what recovery looks like.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="treat-list">
      {%- for item in specialties %}
      <li>
        <a href="/specialties/{{ item.slug }}/">
          <span class="treat-name">{{ item.name }}</span>
          <span class="treat-summary">{{ item.summary }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-wash" aria-labelledby="robotic-heading">
  <div class="container robotic-grid">
    <div class="robotic-text">
      <h2 id="robotic-heading">Neck surgery without a scar on the neck</h2>
      <p>Cancers of the mouth, throat and salivary glands often need lymph nodes removed from the neck. The usual operation leaves a long scar across the neck that is visible every day.</p>
      <p><strong>RIA-MIND</strong> (Robotic Infraclavicular Approach for Minimally Invasive Neck Dissection) is a technique Dr. Suraga developed and published. The robot works through a small cut below the collarbone, where clothing covers it.</p>
      <p><strong>PRIA</strong> applies the same scar-conscious thinking to robotic parotidectomy, the removal of a parotid salivary gland.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/robotic-surgery/">How robotic surgery works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="incision-figure">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 320 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="incision-title incision-desc">
        <title id="incision-title">Where the incision is made</title>
        <desc id="incision-desc">Outline of the head, neck and shoulders. A long dashed line on the side of the neck shows the usual neck dissection incision. A short solid blue line below the collarbone shows the RIA-MIND incision.</desc>
        <g class="fig-body">
          <ellipse cx="160" cy="72" rx="44" ry="54"/>
          <path d="M136 120 L132 170 M184 120 L188 170"/>
          <path d="M132 170 C108 180 62 184 30 208 L18 300 M188 170 C212 180 258 184 290 208 L302 300"/>
          <path class="fig-clavicle" d="M152 194 C124 198 94 190 60 202 M168 194 C196 198 226 190 260 202"/>
        </g>
        <path class="fig-usual" d="M110 100 C114 138 128 166 156 184"/>
        <path class="fig-riamind" d="M76 222 L114 217"/>
      </svg>
      <figcaption>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch legend-usual"></span>Usual neck dissection incision</span>
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="legend-swatch legend-riamind"></span>RIA-MIND incision, below the collarbone</span>
        <span class="figure-note">Simplified illustration. Incision placement is planned for each patient.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-photo">
      <img src="/assets/photos/dr-suraga-white-coat.jpg"
        alt="Portrait of Dr. Suraga Belakawadi"
        sizes="(min-width: 60em) 30vw, 100vw">
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2 id="about-heading">About Dr. Suraga</h2>
      <p>Dr. Suraga Belakawadi is a surgical oncologist: a surgeon who specialises in removing cancer. He completed his MCh in Surgical Oncology with a gold medal, after a DNB in General Surgery, and went on to a fellowship in robotic and laparoscopic surgical oncology.</p>
      <p>He works as an {{ site.position }} at {{ site.hospital }}, {{ site.area }}.</p>
      <p>Through <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" rel="noopener">@onco_outreach</a> on Instagram, he shares short, practical videos on spotting cancer early and understanding treatment.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/about/">Training and experience</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="doctors-band" aria-labelledby="doctors-heading">
  <div class="container doctors-inner">
    <div>
      <h2 id="doctors-heading">Referring a patient?</h2>
      <p>Share the case on WhatsApp or call directly. Dr. Suraga is glad to discuss whether robotic or minimally invasive surgery suits your patient.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/for-doctors/">Information for doctors</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappLink('Hello Dr. Suraga, I would like to refer a patient.') }}">{{ icon("whatsapp") }}WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="visit-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="visit-heading">Visit the clinic</h2>
    <div class="visit-grid">
    <div>
      <dl class="visit-list">
        <div><dt>{{ icon("clock") }}Clinic hours</dt><dd>{{ site.hours }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{{ icon("pin") }}Hospital</dt><dd>{{ site.hospital }}<br>{{ site.address or site.area }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>{{ icon("phone") }}Phone</dt><dd><a href="{{ site.phone | telLink }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="visit-actions">
      <p>Please bring any scans, biopsy reports and previous treatment records to your first visit.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/appointment/">Book appointment</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ site.mapUrl }}" rel="noopener">{{ icon("pin") }}Get directions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
